    "answer": "The requested subtotal cannot be calculated due to missing unit price data for SKU CT-10C in the catalogue. Although the tool result shows a calculation of 1950 INR (650 * 3), the unit price for CT-10C was not successfully retrieved from the catalogue CSV. The retrieved chunk for CT-10C (chunk_id: f82c88dcc0f96024) states the unit price is 650 INR, but this value was not confirmed through the tool execution. The tool result indicates no matches in the CSV, which contradicts the text. Therefore, the data inconsistency invalidates the calculation.",
    "evidence": []
  },
  "cited_sources": [],
  "tool_results": [
    {
      "name": "csv_lookup",
      "arguments": {
        "source": "catalogue.csv",
        "column": "unit_price_inr",
        "value": "CT-10C"
      },
      "result": {
        "source": "catalogue.csv",
        "rows": [],
        "total_matches": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "calculator",
      "arguments": {
        "expression": "650 * 3"
      },
